SUMMARY:Georgina-Brock Garden Club - Top 20 'Must Have' Plants for Your Perennial Garden
DESCRIPTION:Top 20 ‘Must Have’ Plants for Your Perennial Garden with Sherry Dodson. A plant lover and Master Gardener\, Sherry is creating gardens from scratch at her new residence in Beaverton. Her 1.3 acre property presents limitless possibilities! Sherry will identify plants that she loves and explain why she wants them in her new gardens. This informative talk is ideal for both new and seasoned gardeners.\nEveryone welcome.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/georgina-brock-garden-club-top-20-must-have-plants-for-your-perennial-garden/
LOCATION:Pefferlaw Lions Community Centre\, 38 Pete's Lane\, Pefferlaw\, L0E 1N0
