SUMMARY:Agincourt Garden Club Presents James Graham on Garden Ramblings + Flower Show
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, June 8/26 at 7:30 PM – please join us \nThe Agincourt Garden Club has been around for over 70 yrs. catering to novice\, regular and advanced gardeners. \nFlower and flower design show entries are due on the table by 7:15PM \nGuest speaker/Comedian: James Graham talking on Garden Ramblings \nAnnouncements for upcoming events \nEnjoy learning\, laughter\, friendship and dessert \nKnox United Christian Education Center \n2575 Midland @ Sheppard\, bus stop + access driveway off Rural Ave \nFor further information\, reach out to our Facebook Page\, Instagram Page under AGC Agincourt Garden Club or www.gardenontario.org/agincourtgardenclub \ncheryl.penner@hotmail.com
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/agincourt-garden-club-presents-james-graham-on-garden-ramblings-flower-show/
LOCATION:Knox United Christian Education Center\, 2575 Midland Ave @ Sheppard\, Agincourt\, M1S 1R4\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Community Event,Flower & Vegetable Show,Guest Speaker
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/DSC3808-5-scaled.jpg
